# The bare domain. Workers Assets runs with html_handling "none" -- every link
# on this site is written out in full ("/pages/cart.html") and the default
# would 307 each of them to an extensionless URL -- but that also means "/"
# matches no file on its own. 200 is a rewrite, not a redirect: the visitor
# keeps the "/" URL and gets the prerendered home page.
/    /index.html    200
